= Overrun

Somehow, someway, the KPD emerges victorious over both the reactionaries and the republicans! The military immediately try putting them down, but it's no use. Within this period of struggle the RFB has militarized to the point of overrunning the Reichswehr easily. Ernst Thälmann has thus, dismantled the institution entirely, replacing to a revolutionary army similar to that of the USSR.

The majority of our party is crushed and sent into prison, with some escaping to nearby countries. The future of Germany remains uncertain, as now it is being treated like a pariah state, with it's only other ally being the USSR. 

- @game_over: Game over.